  "sources": {
    "icom-civ-ic705": "IC-705 CI-V Reference Guide (data/third-party/IC-705_ENG_CI-V_6.txt, local only) printed p.4 / txt page 5, command 15: 02 S-meter 0000=S0 0120=S9 0241=S9+60 dB; 11 Po 0000=0% 0143=50% 0213=100%; 12 SWR 0000=1.0 0048=1.5 0080=2.0 0120=3.0; 13 ALC 0000=min 0120=max; 14 COMP 0000=0 dB 0130=15 dB 0210=25.5 dB; 15 Vd 0000=0 V 0075=5 V 0241=16 V; 16 Id 0000=0 A 0121=2 A 0241=4 A. Values between the cited points are linear interpolations, not calibrations. Tuner/TX state: 1C 00 (00=RX 01=TX) and 1C 01 (00=OFF 01=ON 02=Tune) on printed p.14 / txt page 15",
    "ftx1-rm-sm": "docs/FTX1-KNOWLEDGE.md RM row (CAT Operation Reference Manual 2508-C): RM P1 = 1 S-MAIN, 2 S-SUB, 3 COMP, 4 ALC, 5 PO, 6 SWR, 7 IDD, 8 VDD; raw 000-255, uncalibrated; SM row: SM P1 nnn 0-255",
    "ftx1-community": "docs/FTX1-KNOWLEDGE.md RM row, host-side scales of bg7nzl-ftx1ctl (third_party/ftx1/bg7nzl-ftx1ctl/ftx1cat.py): VDD raw*13.8/203 V, IDD raw*3/255 A, COMP raw*30/255 dB, ALC raw*200/252 % (max 200), SWR 1+0.333(e^(0.0151 raw)-1) (infinity at 255), PO piecewise linear up to 15 W for the FIELD HEAD only (PC P1 = 1); with the SPA-1 (PC P1 = 2) the PO scale is pendiente de fuente and PO stays raw; estimates, not calibrated",
    "ftx1-s-bg7nzl": "ftx1cat.py s_meter_from_raw: raw 14=S1, 42=S3, 81=S5, 103=S7, 128=S9, 202=+20, 233=+40, 255=+60 dB; approximate dial calibration",
    "hamlib": "rigctld levels STRENGTH, RFPOWER_METER_WATTS, SWR, ALC, only when the running rigctld advertises them (remote-agent.cjs readHamlibMeters)",
    "icom-civ-15-02": "Icom CI-V Reference Guide p.4: 15 02 S-meter 0000=S0, 0120=S9, 0241=S9+60 dB",
    "hamlib-caps": "data/remote-hamlib-caps.json (facts extracted from the Hamlib backend caps; each row names the caps file and line)"
  },
